 Du Fu 's legacy is immense . He is often referred to as the " Sage of Poetry " ( 诗圣 ) , and his works are considered the pinnacle of Chinese poetry . His influence extends beyond the literary world into the cultural and political spheres . In the 19th century , the Taiping Heavenly Kingdom used his poetry as a source of inspiration for their revolutionary movement . In the 20th century , the Chinese Communist Party has used his poetry as a source of inspiration for their political campaigns . 

 In the modern era , Du Fu 's works have been translated into many languages and are studied
